  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CALL_THE_AIFON": "Call the Aifon",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CALL_THE_AIFON_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once: the Aifon are born as your vassal in two coastal cities of unowned land, with four Axemen and two Archers.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Their hero: the Deep Mother, a Kraken.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Their land units have Water Walking: they cross water without ships.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Needs an unowned coast or island with two free coastal sites.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CALL_THE_AIFON_PEDIA": "The Lanun tell of an isle that rises from the sea for the people of the deep. Call, and the deep answers.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: call them to the far coast of the rival you will fight across the water.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_CALL_THE_AIFON": "Call the Aifon",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_CALL_THE_AIFON_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The Aifon are born as your vassal in two coastal cities of the largest unowned land region with two free coastal sites.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Each city has two Axemen and an Archer; the Deep Mother, a Kraken, in the first.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_PALACE_AIFON": "Palace",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DEEP_MOTHER": "The Deep Mother",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DEEP_MOTHER_PEDIA": "The Deep Mother is older than the Lanun's oldest songs. The Aifon say the sea is only her shadow.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_DEEP_MOTHER_STRATEGY": "A Kraken hero: the Aifon's navy on its own.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_AIFON_DESC": "The Aifon",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_AIFON_SHORT_DESC": "Aifon",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_AIFON_ADJECTIVE": "Aifon",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_AIFON_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Its land units have Water Walking: they cross water without ships.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: the Deep Mother, a Kraken.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_AIFON_PEDIA": "The Aifon are the sea-god's people of the Lanun's tales, who walk on the waves as others walk on roads.",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_1": "Aifon Isle",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_2": "Tidecrown",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_3": "Saltreach",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_4": "Foamhold",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_5": "Deepmoor",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_6": "Wavewatch",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_7": "Brinemere",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_AIFON_8": "Coral Gate",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_DEEP_MOTHER": "The Deep Mother",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_DEEP_MOTHER_PEDIA": "The Aifon have no king. They have the Deep Mother, who speaks through the tides, and they listen."
  }
